From d424ca0252fd394ad970141d98c1185ea4680cf5 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Tue, 27 Oct 2026 05:28:04 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1/3] refactor: drive accent and zinc colors from CSS variables

Replaces ~180 hardcoded orange-* classes with accent-* tokens backed by
CSS variables, and routes the canvas colors (hero + skills constellation)
through the same variable. No visual change by default; this is the
groundwork for the theme and accent controls in the next commits.
