From bd28dce1711ab8e4542709ea9c61461fd3327abd Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Tue, 27 Oct 2026 05:40:10 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 2/3] feat: Control Panel with accent colors, light/dark,
 effect toggles and Lite mode

- New customize drawer (gear button in the navbar) built on a native <dialog>:
  focus trap, Esc to close, arrow-key navigation inside radio groups.
- Accent color: 6 curated swatches, applied site-wide including the canvases.
- Effects: animations, particle network, 3D tilt, magnetic buttons, cursor glow,
  scanlines. Defaults respect prefers-reduced-motion until the user opts in.
- Lite/Full moved from the navbar into the panel.
- Changes reveal with a circular View Transition where supported.
- Appearance is applied before first paint and re-applied on client-side
  navigation, so nothing flashes and choices persist in localStorage.
