  around the cursor, angular panels with corner brackets that expand on hover,
  Chakra Petch + JetBrains Mono type, scroll-progress line.
- Terminal: monospace throughout, glowing phosphor text, square edges,
  blinking cursor after the page title, scanlines with a soft vignette.
- Card spotlight: cards glow where the cursor is (on by default in both
  themes, optional in Clean).
- HUD fonts load only when one of these themes is selected, so the default
  Clean theme costs nothing extra.
- Both themes follow the chosen accent color and work with every effect toggle.
